   "source": [
    "1. Write a Python program to calculate the sum of two numbers. It should take two numbers as input from the user, store them in variables, and print their sum."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "80cf1850-5cdc-46f0-be82-1bf97a6ccc20",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "2. Write a Python program to calculate the area of a triangle. It should take the base and height as input from the user and print the area of the triangle.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Area = 0.5 × Base × Height"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "121aa4af-e43e-425c-8b74-e639890134d8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "3. Write a Python program to calculate the area of a rectangle. It should take the length and width as input from the user and print the area of the rectangle.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Area = Length × Width"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
