   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "5. Write a Python program to calculate the simple interest. It should take the principal amount, rate of interest, and time as input from the user and print the simple interest.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Simple Interest = (Principal × Rate × Time) / 100"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
