   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "6. Write a Python program to calculate the average of three numbers. It should take three numbers as input from the user and print their average.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Average = (Number1 + Number2 + Number3) / 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "a71b0518-2b7b-4fad-a481-ff2d831cfa1c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "7. Write a Python program to convert temperature from Celsius to Fahrenheit. It should take the temperature in Celsius as input from the user and print the temperature in Fahrenheit.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Fahrenheit = (Celsius × 9/5) + 32"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "9c1c831b-bba9-45dd-8a65-5ef80e08836b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "8. Write a Python program to calculate the total price of products. It should take the price and quantity as input from the user and print the total amount.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint: Total Price = Price × Quantity"
   ]
  },
