   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "9. Write a Python program to calculate the total marks and percentage of a student. It should take marks in five subjects as input from the user and print the total marks and percentage.\n",
    "\n",
    "Hint:\n",
    "- Total Marks = Subject1 + Subject2 + Subject3 + Subject4 + Subject5\n",
    "- Percentage = (Total Marks / 500) × 100"
   ]
  },
  {
